sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant V as View
    participant P as Sandbox proxy
    participant H as Host
    participant RS as MCP Resource Server
    participant DS as Device Service
    U->>V: taps the switch for Bedroom Lamp
    V->>V: capture id, desired state, expectedVersion. Mark pending.
    V->>P: postMessage tools/call control_device to pinned host origin
    P->>H: relay after source and origin checks
    H->>H: visibility includes app? approval policy for this tool?
    opt host asks for confirmation
        H->>U: Allow IoT Switch to switch on Bedroom Lamp?
        U->>H: Allow
    end
    H->>RS: POST /mcp tools/call with token A and DPoP proof
    RS->>RS: gate, policy, exchange for token B
    RS->>DS: control with token B
    alt applied
        DS-->>RS: device version 8
        RS-->>H: result with structuredContent device
    else version conflict
        DS-->>RS: DEVICE_VERSION_CONFLICT
        RS-->>H: isError, code in _meta iot/error
    end
    H-->>P: JSON-RPC response
    P-->>V: response, source checked by the View
    V->>V: render with textContent. On conflict, re-read before saying anything.
